OL,3,AThree men found guilty of murdering two
OL,4,AAustralian surfer brothers and US
OL,5,Afriend
OL,6,
OL,7,FDebra Robinson, the brother's mother,
OL,8,Ftold the courtroom in the northern Baja
OL,9,FCalifornia state the murders of her
OL,10,Fsons had taken "the future we had
OL,11,Fimagined with them".
OL,13,FDuring the trial the court heard the
OL,14,Ftourists were killed in an apparent
OL,15,Fbotched robbery of their truck in a
OL,16,Fsecluded beach area.
